            "row_content": "<p>We stand behind the quality and effectiveness of our products. <br/><br/>That's why we offer a 90-day money-back guarantee. <br/><br/>If you're not satisfied with your purchase, simply reach out to our customer support team within 90 days, and we'll assist you with a refund.</p>",
